532489121", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1068362535822454_6230875394400575060_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6LVws9OSIkAQ7kNvwEa_1BS&_nc_oc=AdrHInksfcq7Ww-h4nKD_iJS_mfLjLbkpD2XW1UHxUSyYICq2Ov7ltaPFh6gn2mgK0I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMcLlmmxnv1raRLpwA5fDU-OuU1d4J0EYP0GXNl2Vo7BQ&oe=6AD39468"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "2002471743790232", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673751957_2002471747123565_4843422407617544862_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hzDbsC1O5OIQ7kNvwGwPXSs&_nc_oc=AdrZv3r2PA0vBVa0XMpdvLC2tyr9E0N16KcmaXrsBQBZ4bKh7JuuAY1O7CHOAyk2-U4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNWItB5TAqZc_4YWD7X07onW_UynlGtTfMOoualz3oXCg&oe=6AD396B8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Nomsters_Key_Art.png", "id": "1430376912358320", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831279_1430376915691653_6591388710931394295_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QrMYs-o3skkQ7kNvwEHU0QT&_nc_oc=AdrPpV-Xq4QuxdRs0ozkCcBB2JkMhISPLmcQmBot88Jd2nYAviXQ6I71EXABiBPortU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNeA-7KVMoGze4EZiZPNl5iyfjzq7vALr2YimriY8g5Nw&oe=6AD3ACD1"}, "display_name": "Nomsters", "keywords": ["pet", "collection", "idle", "multiplayer", "social"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  \n\n# Collect. Mutate. Trade. Rebirth!\n{2480966755724977}\n**\ud83d\ude0e Become an OG, Join Discord:** https://discord.gg/nomsters\n\nStep into the charming, cozy world of Nomsters, the ultimate relaxing creature-collector in VR! Gather adorable companions, build your dream team, and take them along as you explore and grow together. Whether you\u2019re a casual collector or a completionist, there\u2019s always a new Nomster waiting to be found!\n\n# Key Features\n\ud83d\udc3e **Collect & Mutate**: Discover dozens of unique Nomsters across various rarities. Experiment with mutations to unlock rare, powerful forms, and build the ultimate companion group to take out into the world.\n\n\ud83e\udd1d **Trade with Friends**: Got duplicates or hunting for that missing Nomster? Trade with other players to complete your collection!\n\n\u26cf\ufe0f **Fun Game Modes**: Put your Nomsters to work! Send your companions into Mining to gather valuable resources, or jump into Defense mode to ward off incoming threats and earn exclusive rewards.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Rebirth & Grow**: Power up through the Rebirth system. Reset your progress to unlock new abilities, boost your stats, and upgrade your home base!\n\n**Ready to meet your new best friends?** ", "short_description": "Collect. Mutate. Trade. Rebirth!\n\nStep into the charming, cozy world of Nomsters, the ultimate relaxing creature-collector in VR! Gather adorable companions, build your dream team, and take them along as you explore and grow together. Whether you\u2019re a casual collector or a completionist, there\u2019s always a new Nomster waiting to be found!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.squidostudio.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Squido Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.squidostudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_RE